{"id":"98ee9c2c3c7a3ced","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-game4-minimax-value.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Minimax Value","display":"df-zfc-game4-minimax-value — ZFC Game4 Minimax Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-minimax-value","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-minimax-value"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-minimax-value — ZFC Game4 Minimax Value","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-minimax-value"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-minimax-value</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-minimax-value — ZFC Game4 Minimax Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0,S_1,u,v\\in V\">\\(S_0,S_1,u,v\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4MinimaxValue}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4MinimaxValue}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}minimax\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4MinimaxValue}_S(S_0,S_1,u,v)\\leftrightarrow S_0\\neq\\emptyset\\land S_1\\neq\\emptyset\\land u:S_0\\times S_1\\to\\mathbb R\\land v\\in\\overline{\\mathbb R}\\land v=\\sup_{s_0\\in S_0}\\inf_{s_1\\in S_1}u(s_0,s_1)=\\inf_{s_1\\in S_1}\\sup_{s_0\\in S_0}u(s_0,s_1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}minimax\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4MinimaxValue}_S(S_0,S_1,u,v)\\leftrightarrow S_0\\neq\\emptyset\\land S_1\\neq\\emptyset\\land u:S_0\\times S_1\\to\\mathbb R\\land v\\in\\overline{\\mathbb R}\\land v=\\sup_{s_0\\in S_0}\\inf_{s_1\\in S_1}u(s_0,s_1)=\\inf_{s_1\\in S_1}\\sup_{s_0\\in S_0}u(s_0,s_1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S_0,S_1,u,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4MinimaxValue}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}minimax\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4MinimaxValue}_S(S_0,S_1,u,v)\\leftrightarrow S_0\\neq\\emptyset\\land S_1\\neq\\emptyset\\land u:S_0\\times S_1\\to\\mathbb R\\land v\\in\\overline{\\mathbb R}\\land v=\\sup_{s_0\\in S_0}\\inf_{s_1\\in S_1}u(s_0,s_1)=\\inf_{s_1\\in S_1}\\sup_{s_0\\in S_0}u(s_0,s_1)","display":true}],"bytes":785,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-game4-minimax-value.md|58-df-zfc-game4-minimax-value]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}